details:
(a) the year-wise and scheme-wise details of funds allocated, sanctioned, released and utilised in Assam and NE under PM-DevINE, NESIDS, NEC, Special Packages and other schemes of the Ministry during the last three years;
(b) the district-wise details of projects sanctioned, indicating project name, approved cost, funds released, expenditure, implementing agency, present status and expected completion date;
(c) whether any proposals from Assam are pending approval, district-wise, with reasons for delay; and
(d) the measures taken to ensure equitable distribution of funds, particularly in backward, flood-prone and border districts?

(a) the details of sports infrastructure projects sanctioned under various Central schemes in Assam during the last five years;
(b) the district-wise details of stadiums, synthetic tracks, indoor halls and sports academies established;
(c) whether Government proposes to establish Centres of Excellence in the State for Olympic disciplines;
(d) the financial assistance released; and
(e) the roadmap for strengthening sports infrastructure in the North Eastern Region?

(a) whether Government has undertaken new initiatives under the Act East Policy benefiting Assam;
(b) if so, the details thereof;
(c) whether Assam is proposed to be developed as a trade gateway to South-East Asia; and
(d) the major infrastructure projects being implemented?

(a) the number of PM SHRI Schools approved and operational in Assam, district-wise;
(b) the funds released for strengthening infrastructure and smart classrooms under the scheme;
(c) whether Government proposes to include additional schools from Assam under the PM SHRI scheme; and 
(d) the expected outcomes of the scheme in improving the quality of school education?

(a) the initiatives taken to strengthen the handloom sector in Assam;
(b) whether Government has undertaken any assessment of the socio-economic condition of handloom weavers, if so, the details thereof;
(c) the number of weavers in Assam benefited under various Central handloom schemes during the last three years, scheme-wise;
(d) whether Government has established new Common Facility Centres, provided marketing support and proposes additional financial assistance for handloom weavers; and
(e) the steps taken to improve the income of traditional weavers and the expected impact of these measures on employment in the handloom sector?

(a) the present status of implementation of announcement made by the Finance Minister regarding the development of the Iconic City of Sivasagar and the establishment of an Iconic Museum in Assam;
(b) the details of funds sanctioned, released and utilized for implementation of the project, year-wise;
(c) the details of monuments and heritage sites, including State-protected monuments in Assam, that have been covered under the said initiative; and
(d) the present stage of execution of the project, along with the expected timeline for its completion?

(a) whether Government has taken any special initiatives to promote scientific fish farming and integrated aquaculture in Assam;
(b) the details of financial assistance provided under Pradhan Mantri Matsya Sampada Yojana (PMMSY) to Assam during the last three years, district-wise;
(c) whether Government proposes to establish additional fish hatcheries, cold chain infrastructure and fish feed mills in the State; and
(d) the steps taken to enhance fish production and reduce dependence on fish imports from other States?

(a) the total Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) expenditure incurred in the state of Assam during the last five years;
(b) the details of CSR projects implemented, sector-wise;
(c) whether Government proposes measures to encourage greater CSR investment in the North Eastern Region; and
(d) the mechanism to monitor the effectiveness of CSR-funded projects?

(a) whether Government has formulated a comprehensive strategy to promote MSME-led industrialisation in Assam and the North Eastern Region under the vision of Viksit Bharat@2047;
(b) the details of MSME clusters approved in Assam since 2021;
(c) whether Government proposes to establish new clusters for tea, bamboo, agarwood, handloom, food processing and petrochemical downstream industries; and
(d) the expected investment and employment generation from these initiatives?

(a) the achievements of the Jal Jeevan Mission (JJM) in the State of Assam since its launch;
(b) the increase in Functional Household Tap Connections provided in rural Assam;
(c) the steps taken for source sustainability and water quality monitoring; and
(d) the roadmap to achieve universal tap water coverage?

(a) the number of athletes from Assam who have benefited under the Khelo India Scheme during the last three years;
(b) the details of scholarships and financial assistance provided to such athletes;
(c) whether Government proposes to expand Khelo India Centres in rural and tribal areas of the State; and
(d) the measures taken to identify and nurture sporting talent at the grassroots level?

(a) whether Government has reviewed the progress of eco-tourism projects in the North Eastern Region (NER);
(b) the details of eco-tourism projects sanctioned in Assam during the last three years;
(c) whether local communities and Self Help Groups are being involved in such projects; and
(d) the steps taken to promote sustainable tourism in the region?

(a) whether Government has reviewed the progress of the proposed 4th Ammonia-Urea Plant at Brahmaputra Valley Fertilizer Corporation Limited (BVFCL), Namrup;
(b) if so, the details of the action taken so far;
(c) whether the project is expected to enhance domestic Urea production and reduce dependence on imports; and
(d) if so, the estimated production capacity thereof?

(a) the overall progress achieved under the 'PM Surya Ghar: Muft Bijli Yojana' (PMSGMBY) up to May 2026, including the number of rooftop solar installations completed and the number of households benefited thereunder;
(b) the details of the Central Financial Assistance released under the scheme, along with the average time taken for processing and disbursing subsidy claims;
(c) the measures taken to address implementation challenges under the scheme, particularly with regard to delays in installation in low-performing States, DISCOM readiness and grid connectivity; and
(d) the expected contribution of the Scheme towards achieving the target of one crore rooftop solar households and its impact on distributed renewable energy generation and the reduction of carbon emissions?

(a) whether Government has reviewed Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) expenditure in Assam during the last three years;
(b) if so, the details thereof, sector-wise;
(c) whether Government proposes to encourage higher CSR investment in education, healthcare and skill development in the North Eastern Region; and
(d) if so, the details thereof?

(a) whether Government has any proposal to support the sustainable urban development of heritage cities and towns in the State of Assam;
(b) if so, the details thereof;
(c) whether Sivasagar and Majuli have been considered under any such initiative; and
(d) if so, the details thereof?

(a) whether Government has reviewed the implementation of PM-DevINE projects in Assam;
(b) if so, the details thereof;
(c) the amount sanctioned and released, so far; and
(d) the district-wise progress of the projects?

(a) whether Government is aware of the present status of conservation of Moidam No. 2 of Charaideo, Assam excavated by the Archaeological Survey of India (ASI) during 2000–2003;
(b) if so, the details of conservation measures undertaken, so far; and
(c) whether Government proposes to take any further steps for its preservation and maintenance and if so, the details thereof?

(a) whether Government proposes to upgrade National Highways in Assam to four-lane standards;
(b) if so, the details thereof;
(c) the funds allocated during the last three years; and
(d) the district-wise status of ongoing projects?

(a) whether Government proposes to establish new AIIMS-like institutions or medical colleges in Assam;
(b) if so, the details thereof;
(c) the number of projects under implementation; and
(d) the expected date of completion?

(a) the present status of implementation of MSME Cluster Development Programme, including number of Common Facility Centres (CFCs) established and operational as of May 2026, State and district-wise including the State of Assam;
(b) the details of infrastructure created under cluster development projects, including testing labs, training centres and shared production facilities;
(c) whether integration of MSME clusters with supply chains, vendor networks and export-oriented production systems has been undertaken;
(d) if so, the details thereof; and
(e) the impact achieved on value addition, employment generation and competitiveness of MSME clusters?

(a) whether Government proposes to expand regional air connectivity in Assam under the UDAN Scheme;
(b) if so, the details thereof;
(c) the airports proposed to be upgraded; and
(d) the expected timeline?
